      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwatanga ikimazi c’ishimwe kivuye mu bitungwa bininibinini, uze ushikane imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ishuri canke inka ivyara, ariko itagira agasembwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwutanze ico kimazi aze arambike ikiganza ciwe ku mutwe waco hanyuma agikererere ku muryango w’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro. Maze abaherezi bene Aroni baze bamijagire amaraso yaco ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aze akure kuri ico kimazi c’ishimwe ivyo gushikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nk’ishikanwa ryo guturirwa n’umuriro rigizwe n’ibi bikurikira: ibinure vyose bifatanye n’ivyo mu nda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’ibiri ku mbavu hamwe n’igice cose gipfutse igitigu, ico azokuranako n’amafyigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo vyose bene Aroni baze babituririre ku gicaniro, hejuru y’ikimazi co guturirwa kigeretse ku nkwi; iryo ni ishikanwa rituriwe n’umuriro, rimota neza, rinezereza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
