          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arambike ikiganza ciwe ku mutwe waco hanyuma agikererere imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro. Aze aheze amijagire amaraso yaco ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku kimazi yatanze aze akureko ishikanwa ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ryo guturirwa n’umuriro ry’ibihimba bikurikira: ibinure vyose bipfutse ivyo mu nda canke ibifatanye na vyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’ivyo mu mbavu, n’igice gipfutse igitigu, ico azokurirako rimwe n’amafyigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuherezi aze abituririre ku gicaniro nk’imfungurwa zishikaniwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", bibe ishikanwa rimota neza. Ibinure vyose ni ivy’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
